 0  98  0   UberASM Object 98: Free Vertical Scroll\n-----\nMakes the camera follow Mario up and down.
 0  99  0   UberASM Object 99: Lock Horizontal Scroll\n-----\nPrevents the camera from scrolling left or right.
 0  9A  0   UberASM Object 9A: Invisible Mario\n-----\nMakes Mario invisible.
 0  9B  0   UberASM Object 9B: No Power-ups\n-----\nPrevent Mario from collecting any power-ups, including to the item box. Can be used to reset power-up state.
 0  9C  0   UberASM Object 9C: Enable 8-frame Cape Float\n-----\nApply a consistent 8 frame counter after the input is registered to adjust Mario's falling speed with cape.
 0  9D  0   UberASM Object 9D: Remove Cape Float Delay\n-----\nSets the delay before Mario starts floating with cape to zero frames.
 0  9E  0   UberASM Object 9E: Disable Cape Flight\n-----\nPrevents Mario from ever entering flight with cape.
 0  9F  0   UberASM Object 9F: Death on Power-up Loss\n-----\nLosing a power up will kill Mario instantly. Makes all hurt blocks death blocks and all damaging sprites lethal.
 0  A0  0   UberASM Object A0: Press L & R To Die\n-----\nEnabled killing the player if L and R are pressed. Useful for a quick reset.
 0  A1  0   UberASM Object A1: Disable Screen Shake\n-----\nStops all Vanilla sources of Layer 1 screen shake.
 0  A2  0   UberASM Object A2: Prevent Item Box Storage\n-----\No power-ups can be stored to the Item box.
 0  B0  0   UberASM Object B0: Set Retry Type to Instant\n-----\nMake the retry skip using prompt and restart instantly after dying.
 0  B1  0   UberASM Object B1: Set Retry Type to Prompt\n-----\nSets the retry system to use a prompt that says "Retry" in the middle of the screen.
 0  B2  0   UberASM Object B2: Set Retry Type to Vanilla\n-----\nSets the retry system back to using Vanilla death routine.
 0  B3  0   UberASM Object B3: Bottom Left Retry Prompt\n-----\nMove the "Retry" prompt to the bottom left if Prompt Retry is active (by default it's in the middle).
 0  B4  0   UberASM Object B4: No Power Ups from Midways\n-----\nDisable gaining a power-up (mushroom) from a midway point.
 0  BA  0   UberASM Object BA: Display Sprite Timer\n-----\nShows the level timer from the Retry System's sprite status bar.
 0  BB  0   UberASM Object BB: Display Coins Counters\n-----\nShows the coin counters from the Retry System's sprite status bar.
 0  BC  0   UberASM Object BC: Display Item Box\n-----\nShows the item box from the Retry System's sprite status bar
 0  C0  0   UberASM Object C0: Start with a Mushroom\n-----\nHave the player start the level with a Mushroom.
 0  C1  0   UberASM Object C1: Start with Cape\n-----\nHave the player start the level with a Cape.
 0  C2  0   UberASM Object C2: Start with Fire Flower\n-----\nHave the player start the level with a Fire Flower.
 0  C3  0   UberASM Object C3: Start with Star Power\n-----\nHave the player start the level with Star Power. Not infinite, lasts as long as a normal Star.
 0  C4  0   UberASM Object C4: Start on Green Yoshi\n-----\nHave the player start the level on a Green Yoshi.
 0  C5  0   UberASM Object C5: Start on Yellow Yoshi\n-----\nHave the player start the level on a Yellow Yoshi.
 0  C6  0   UberASM Object C6: Start on Blue Yoshi\n-----\nHave the player start the level on a Blue Yoshi.
 0  C7  0   UberASM Object C7: Start on Red Yoshi\n-----\nHave the player start the level on a Red Yoshi.
 0  C8  0   UberASM Object C8: Start in Spin Jump State\n-----\nHave the player start the level spinning (most useful when Mario is in the air).
 0  C9  0   UberASM Object C9: Start in OFF State\n-----\nStarts the level with the ON/OFF state in the OFF state.
 0  CA  0   UberASM Object CA: Start in ON State\n-----\nStarts the level with the ON/OFF state in the ON state.
 0  D0  0   UberASM Object D0: Toggle Statusbar\n-----\nPlacing the object hides the Layer 3 statusbar.
 0  D1  0   UberASM Object D1: Toggle Screen Scroll\n-----\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents scrolling the screen with L or R.
 0  D2  0   UberASM Object D2: Toggle Spin Jump Fireballs\n-----\nPrevent Mario from shooting fireballs while spin jumping.
 0  D3  0   UberASM Object D3: Toggle Block Duplication\n-----\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents block duplication.
 0  D4  0   UberASM Object D4: Toggle Springboard Fixes\n-----\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents re-grabbing kicked springboards and them zeroing your speed when grabbed. (Enabling spring midairs).
 0  D5  0   UberASM Object D5: Toggle Cape Turnaround\n-----\nDisable the effects of the patch that makes turning around with cape consistent on button press.
 0  D6  0   UberASM Object D6: Toggle Rope Glitch\n-----\nToggle off the fixes for the air climb rope glitch.
 0  D7  0   UberASM Object D7: Toggle Spin Jump\n-----\nToggle spin jump OFF, i.e. no Spin Jump.
